---
description: Rules for building the Sparkwing website
alwaysApply: true
---
Read docs/website/REQUIREMENTS.md before starting any task. Build the deep teal design only.

- Copy comes from design/source and the requirements. Don't reword it. Never reword Privacy or Terms.
- Use tokens from src/styles/tokens.css for every colour, font, size and space. No inline styles. No raw hex outside the tokens file.
- Build shared components first, then pages. Compare each page with design/screens at 390, 768, 1024 and 1440.
- WCAG 2.2 AA is required. Anything that moves needs a pause control and must respect reduced motion.
- Only two forms: beta application and enquiry modal. No newsletter signup, no trackers or pixels other than Cloudflare Web Analytics.
- Treat the website chat as hostile territory. Follow docs/website/CHATBOT.md. Never give it tools, private data or shared secrets.
- Sparkkeeper doesn't issue invoices or file taxes. Never imply it does, and never say it is BIR accredited.
- Company details come from one config file. Don't hard-code the ABN.
- Keep CNAME. Work on a branch and open a pull request for Elly to review.
